@startuml
title AnimeDex ANI-WRK 2.0.0 (proposta) — Edge e worker
actor "Cliente Stremio" as Stremio
participant "Supabase Edge" as Edge
participant "Proxy HTTPS" as Proxy
participant "Express Worker" as Worker
participant "security-policy.cjs" as Policy
participant "Puppeteer / API" as Source

Stremio -> Edge : Catalog / Meta / Stream
Edge -> Edge : secrets BROWSER_SCRAPER_URL + TOKEN
Edge -> Proxy : GET /api/* + Bearer (HTTPS)
Proxy -> Worker : GET /api/* + Bearer
Worker -> Policy : verifyBearer()
alt ausente ou incorreto
  Policy --> Worker : false
  Worker --> Proxy : HTTP 401
else token válido
  Policy --> Worker : true
  Worker -> Policy : assertAllowedUrl() / redirects
  alt URL ou redirect proibidos
    Policy --> Worker : erro
    Worker --> Proxy : falha (sem fetch ao host negado)
  else destino permitido
    Worker -> Source : fetch/Puppeteer interceptado
    Source --> Worker : JSON ou HTML
    Worker --> Proxy : HTTP 200
  end
end
Proxy --> Edge : status e corpo
Edge --> Stremio : resposta ou fallback aplicável
note over Worker,Source
TLS, egress e hardening Chromium ainda são gates.
end note
@enduml
